&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_de_6_epics_van_de_routekaart&quot;&gt;de 6 &lt;code&gt;EPICs&lt;/code&gt; van de routekaart&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_waarom_werkt_het&quot;&gt;Waarom werkt het&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_conclusie_de_ontbrekende_schakel&quot;&gt;Conclusie: De ontbrekende schakel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_referenties&quot;&gt;Referenties&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;leestijd : 8 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twee weken geleden lanceerde ik`capsule-gradle`— een plugin die een deck transformeert reveal.js in een WebM-videocapsule met TTS. Vandaag voeg ik een nieuwe plugin toe: &lt;code&gt;hyperframes-gradle&lt;/code&gt;. Het doet iets wat capsule-gradle niet doet : zet de AsciiDoc &lt;strong&gt;rechtstreeks&lt;/strong&gt; om naar een MP4-video, zonder reveal.js te gebruiken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hier is waarom deze plug-in bestaat, hoe hij samenwerkt met het bestaande, en wat de HyperFrames-engine van HeyGen toevoegt aan de pijplijn voor contentproductie&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_het_gat_in_de_videopijplijn&quot;&gt;Het gat in de videopijplijn&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mijn documentaire pijplijn produceert twee soorten video&amp;#8217;s :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revisiecapsule&lt;/strong&gt; (capsule-gradle) — een deck reveal.js opgenomen in WebM met&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;narration TTS. Perfect om een module te herzien.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;animatieslides&lt;/strong&gt; (slider-gradle) — een interactieve reveal.js HTML-deck voor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;de fysieke trainer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maar er ontbreekt een derde formaat: de &lt;strong&gt;video standalone&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5555%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 5.5565%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Gebruikscase&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Huidige oplossing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;tekort&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Slides van de trainer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;slider-gradle → reveal.js&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;✅&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;capsule revisie&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;capsule-gradle → WebM&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;✅&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;teaser video&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;❌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geanimeerde technische demo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;geen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;❌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doc-naar-video&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;❌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Het eerste use case is cruciaal: hoe automatisch te genereren een video van 60 seconden die een project of module presenteert, met GSAP-animaties, vertelling TTS, en achtergrondmuziek — alles vanuit hetzelfde AsciiDoc-bestand wat de slides ?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capsule-gradle kan niet reageren: het heeft &lt;strong&gt;al&lt;/strong&gt; een reveal.js-deck nodig. slider-gradle produceert dit deck goed, maar het is niet ontworpen voor het renderen van video. Er was een &lt;strong&gt;direct&lt;/strong&gt; pijplijn nodig: AsciiDoc → video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_hyperframes_de_motor&quot;&gt;HyperFrames : De Motor&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ik heb ontdekthttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes[HyperFrames] il y a enkele dagen. Het is een open-source framework (Apache 2.0) gemaakt door HeyGen, de eenhoorn van de AI-video. 22 700 sterren op GitHub. De pitch houdt in een zin :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schrijf HTML. Weergeef video. Gebouwd voor agenten.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Het principe: je schrijft HTML met`data-*`attributes, u verwijst een animatie GSAP (of CSS, Lottie, Three.js…), en de motor rendert alles als MP4 via Puppeteer (headless Chrome) + FFmpeg. Deterministisch resultaat: dezelfde input, zelfde frames, zelfde video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;div id=&quot;stage&quot; data-composition-id=&quot;intro&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-width=&quot;1920&quot; data-height=&quot;1080&quot;&amp;gt;
  &amp;lt;video class=&quot;clip&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-duration=&quot;6&quot; data-track-index=&quot;0&quot;
         src=&quot;background.mp4&quot; muted playsinline&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/video&amp;gt;

  &amp;lt;h1 id=&quot;title&quot; class=&quot;clip&quot; data-start=&quot;1&quot; data-duration=&quot;4&quot; data-track-index=&quot;1&quot;&amp;gt;
    Formation Docker &amp;amp; Kubernetes
  &amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;

  &amp;lt;audio data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-duration=&quot;6&quot; data-track-index=&quot;2&quot;
         data-volume=&quot;0.3&quot; src=&quot;music.wav&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/audio&amp;gt;

  &amp;lt;script src=&quot;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;
  &amp;lt;script&amp;gt;
    const tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });
    tl.from(&quot;#title&quot;, { opacity: 0, y: 40, duration: 0.8 }, 1);
    window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};
    window.__timelines.intro = tl;
  &amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wat maakt HyperFrames anders dan Remotion? Geen React, geen bundler, geen JSX. Ruwe HTML die AI-agents van nature kunnen schrijven. Het is &lt;strong&gt;exact&lt;/strong&gt; afgestemd op mijn pipeline: planner-gradle met deepseek kan deze HTML genereren vanuit een SPG/SPD-plan, en een Gradle-plugin kan het converteren naar MP4.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_de_architectuur_van_de_plugin&quot;&gt;De architectuur van de plugin&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;hyperframes-gradle volgt hetzelfde patroon als al mijn plugins : de &lt;a href=&quot;0124_architecture_plugin_gradle_racine_consommateur_independant_post.html&quot;&gt;patroon „Plugin Onafhankelijk + Wortel Consument“&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;hyperframes-gradle/
├── settings.gradle.kts          ← racine consommateur (dogfood)
├── build.gradle.kts              ← 3 lignes : apply plugin hyperframes
├── hyperframes-plugin/           ← BUILD INDÉPENDANT
│   ├── gradlew                    ← son propre wrapper
│   ├── build.gradle.kts           ← java-gradle-plugin
│   ├── src/main/kotlin/education/cccp/hyperframes/
│   │   ├── HyperframesPlugin.kt
│   │   ├── GenerateHyperframesHtmlTask.kt
│   │   ├── RenderHyperframesTask.kt
│   │   └── HyperframesExtension.kt
│   ├── .agents/                   ← gouvernance agent
│   └── doc/
│       └── HYPERFRAMES_ARCHITECTURE.adoc
└── video.yml                      ← configuration dogfood&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_pipeline_in_vier_stappen&quot;&gt;De pipeline in vier stappen&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title pijplijn hyperframes-gradle
rectangle &quot;AsciiDoc
bron&quot; as adoc #LightYellow
rectangle &quot;AsciidoctorJ&quot; as asciidoctorj #LightBlue
rectangle &quot;HTML HyperFrames
(data-* attributen)&quot; as html #LightGreen
rectangle &quot;HyperFrames CLI
(Node.js 22+)&quot; as cli #Lavender
rectangle &quot;video.mp4&quot; as mp4 #Gold

adoc -right-&amp;gt; asciidoctorj : parse blocs customs
asciidoctorj -right-&amp;gt; html : génère HTML
html -right-&amp;gt; cli : ProcessBuilder\nnpx hyperframes render
cli -right-&amp;gt; mp4 : Puppeteer + FFmpeg
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AsciidoctorJ&lt;/strong&gt; parst de AsciiDoc-bron en extraheert de aangepaste blokken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;[hyperframes-composition]&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;[hyperframes-track]&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;[hyperframes-animation]&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenerateHyperframesHtmlTask&lt;/strong&gt; genereert het HTML HyperFrames met de&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`data-*`bijbehorende attributen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RenderHyperframesTask&lt;/strong&gt; roept de HyperFrames CLI aan via`ProcessBuilder`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;npx hyperframes render --input index.html --output video.mp4&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MP4 wordt geïmplementeerd in`output/`met een`metadata.json`voor de orkestratie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_dsl_asciidoc&quot;&gt;De DSL AsciiDoc&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De echte toegevoegde waarde van de plugin is de AsciiDoc DSL. De gebruiker Hij schrijft nooit HTML. Hij annoteert zijn bestaande AsciiDoc-document :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;= Formation Docker &amp;amp; Kubernetes
:hyperframes-width: 1920
:hyperframes-height: 1080
:hyperframes-fps: 30

[hyperframes-composition, id=&quot;intro&quot;]
== Introduction

Le titre apparaît avec un fondu GSAP sur fond vidéo.

[hyperframes-track, index=0, start=0, duration=6]
video::assets/background.mp4[muted, playsinline]

[hyperframes-track, index=1, start=1, duration=4]
Formation Docker &amp;amp; Kubernetes

[hyperframes-animation, type=gsap]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;const tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true }); tl.from(&quot;#title&quot;, { opacity: 0, y: 40, duration: 0.8 }, 1); window.&lt;em&gt;timelines = window.&lt;/em&gt;timelines || {}; window.__timelines.intro = tl;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De docinfo-attributen`:hyperframes-width:`) configureren ze de afmetingen. De aangepaste blokken definiëren de composities en de tracks. Het blok `[hyperframes-animation]`bevat de ruwe GSAP-code — dat de AI-agent kan genereren vanuit een beschrijving in natuurlijke taal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_bridge_node_js&quot;&gt;De Bridge Node.js&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Het enige technische wrijvingspunt: HyperFrames is in Node.js/TypeScript, en mijn plugins zijn in Kotlin/JVM. De oplossing is een`ProcessBuilder` :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;class RenderHyperframesTask : DefaultTask() {

    @TaskAction
    fun render() {
        val process = ProcessBuilder(
            &quot;npx&quot;, &quot;hyperframes&quot;, &quot;render&quot;,
            &quot;--input&quot;, inputHtml.absolutePath,
            &quot;--output&quot;, outputMp4.absolutePath
        )
            .inheritIO()
            .start()

        val exitCode = process.waitFor()
        require(exitCode == 0) {
            &quot;HyperFrames render failed with exit code $exitCode&quot;
        }
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Geen koppeling JVM-code ↔ Node.js. Het contract is via de commandregel en bestanden op schijf. Dit is hetzelfde patroon als`plantuml-gradle` (die de PlantUML CLI aanroept) of`slider-gradle`(die AsciidoctorJ aanroept). Niets nieuws onder de zon — gewoon toegepast op een nieuwer hulpmiddel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_twee_videoplugins_twee_gebruiken&quot;&gt;Twee Videoplugins, Twee Gebruiken&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.7619%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 4.762%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;capsule-gradle&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;hyperframes-gradle&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;bron&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Deck reveal.js (bestaande HTML)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;AsciiDoc → HTML HyperFrames&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;gebruikscasus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Revisiecapsule&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;standalone uitlegvideo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Natuur&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Slides → video&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Document → video&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;gegeven&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Playwright Java → WebM&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;HyperFrames CLI → MP4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Animatie&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Overgangen reveal.js inheemse&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;GSAP/CSS data-attributes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;stapel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;100% JVM (Kotlin)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;JVM + Node.js externe CLI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ze vervangen elkaar niet. Ze vullen elkaar aan. De volledige waardeketen:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AsciiDoc ──→ slider-gradle ──→ deck reveal.js ──→ capsule-gradle ──→ WebM (revisiecapsule)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AsciiDoc ──→ hyperframes-gradle ──→ MP4 (standalone video)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De gebruiker schrijft één enkel AsciiDoc-bestand. slider-gradle genereert de slides. capsule-gradle produceert de revisiecapsule. hyperframes-gradle produceert de teaser-video en de technische demo&amp;#8217;s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
