&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;leestijd : 8 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Waarom VS Code installeren in`/opt`of via`apt`als je het kunt zetten in jouw home en jouw IDE transformeren tot een speelterrein zonder ooit te typen`sudo`Hier is het verhaal van een lokale installatie, gevolgd door een hardnekkige strijd om de lettertypen in het menu en de bestandsverkenner te vergroten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;tic&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_overzicht_van_het_parcours&quot;&gt;Overzicht van het parcours&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Développeur as dev
actor &quot;open code
+ LLM&quot; as agent

package &quot;Thuis Gebruiker (~)&quot; #LightGreen {
    package &quot;~/apps/&quot; {
        component &quot;VS Code\n(tarball)&quot; as vscode #SkyBlue
        component &quot;vscode-update.sh&quot; as script #LightYellow
    }
    package &quot;~/.config/Code/&quot; {
        component &quot;settings.json&quot; as settings #Lavender
    }
    package &quot;~/.vscode-custom-css/&quot; {
        component &quot;custom.css
(zoom: 1.25)&quot; as customcss #Lavender
    }
}

cloud &quot;code.visualstudio.com&quot; as download

dev --&amp;gt; vscode : Télécharge &amp;amp; installe
dev --&amp;gt; script : Lance mise à jour
script --&amp;gt; download : wget dernière version
script --&amp;gt; vscode : Remplace + re-patch CSS
agent --&amp;gt; settings : Écrit config
agent --&amp;gt; customcss : Écrit zoom CSS
agent --&amp;gt; vscode : Patch workbench CSS

note right of vscode
  Installation dans le home
  = contrôle total sans sudo
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_de_waarom_vs_code_in_de_home&quot;&gt;De waarom: VS Code in de Home&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_het_probleem_met_de_systeeminstallatie&quot;&gt;Het probleem met de systeeminstallatie&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code geïnstalleerd via`apt`, &lt;code&gt;dnf`of in&lt;/code&gt;/opt`Vergrendelt de toepassingsbestanden achter root-rechten. Elke wijziging van de native CSS, van`product.json`of de installatiemap vereist`sudo`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Echter, wanneer men gebruikt&lt;strong&gt;opencode&lt;/strong&gt;(tool CLI om een LLM op zijn code te besturen), de agent heeft de mogelijkheid nodig om :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Schrijven in de configuratiebestanden (&lt;code&gt;~/.config/Code/User/settings.json&lt;/code&gt;) — dat is al thuis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wijzig de assets van de IDE (CSS van de workbench,&lt;code&gt;product.json&lt;/code&gt;) voor de geavanceerde aanpassingen — dat, is geblokkeerd zonder sudo&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_oplossing_een_lokale_installatie&quot;&gt;De oplossing: een lokale installatie&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We downloaden de officiële tarball-archief en pakken het direct uit in`~/apps/`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;mkdir -p ~/apps
cd ~/apps
wget &quot;https://code.visualstudio.com/sha/download?build=stable&amp;amp;os=linux-x64&quot; -O vscode.tar.gz
tar -xzf vscode.tar.gz
rm vscode.tar.gz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De binaire bevindt zich dan in`~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/bin/code`. Geen`sudo`is niet nodig om een bestand te lezen, te bewerken of te vervangen onder`~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_concrete_voordelen&quot;&gt;Concrete voordelen&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

rectangle &quot;Installatie Systeem\n(/opt, apt, dnf)&quot; #LightCoral {
    card &quot;VS Code eigenschap van root&quot; {
        [CSS du workbench : sudo requis]
        [product.json : sudo requis]
        [Dossier d&#39;install : non modifiable]
    }
}

rectangle &quot;Installatie Home\n(~/apps)&quot; #LightGreen {
    card &quot;VS Code gebruikerseigendom&quot; {
        [CSS du workbench : libre]
        [product.json : libre]
        [Dossier d&#39;install : libre]
        [Script update maison]
    }
}

&quot;Installatie Systeem\n(/opt, apt, dnf)&quot; -right-&amp;gt; &quot;Installatie Home\n(~/apps)&quot; : **Non, merci**\nJe prends le home

note bottom of &quot;Installatie Home\n(~/apps)&quot;
  L&#39;agent opencode+LLM peut
  modifier les fichiers de l&#39;IDE
  sans aucune élévation de privilèges
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 66.6667%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;voordeel&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;detail&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Geen sudo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Alle bestanden van de IDE zijn eigendom van de gebruiker&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Directe wijziging van CSS&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;We kunnen patchen`workbench.desktop.main.css`zonder verhoging van privileges&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Zelfgemaakt update-script&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Een eenvoudig shellscript downloadt, vervangt en repatcht automatisch&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Isolatie&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;De systeeminstallatie is niet vervuild ; rollback = de map verwijderen&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_aanpassen_van_het_lettertype_van_het_hoofdmenu&quot;&gt;Aanpassen van het lettertype van het hoofdmenu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_bevinding&quot;&gt;De bevinding&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Het standaardlettertype van het hoofdmenu (File, Edit, View&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;) en van de vervolgkeuzelijsten is te klein. VS Code biedt geen parameter om het te wijzigen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_techniek_directe_css_patch&quot;&gt;De techniek: directe CSS-patch&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We voegen CSS toe aan het einde van het bestand`workbench.desktop.main.css` :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
autonumber

actor Développeur as dev
participant &quot;workbench.desktop\n.main.css&quot; as css
participant &quot;product.json&quot; as product
participant &quot;VS Code&quot; as vscode

== Patch CSS ==
dev -&amp;gt; css : Ajouter règles font-size\n(.menubar-menu-title, etc.)
dev -&amp;gt; vscode : Redémarrer VS Code
vscode -&amp;gt; vscode : Charge le CSS patché
vscode --&amp;gt; dev : Menus et dropdowns en 23px/22px ✓

== Suppression warning ==
vscode --&amp;gt; dev : ⚠️ &quot;Uw installatie is beschadigd&quot;
dev -&amp;gt; product : Supprimer clé &quot;controlesommen&quot;\n(python3 -c ...)
dev -&amp;gt; vscode : Redémarrer VS Code
vscode --&amp;gt; dev : Plus de warning ✓

note over css, product
  Deux fichiers dans ~/apps/
  = modifiables sans sudo
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;CSS_FILE=&quot;$HOME/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/resources/app/out/vs/workbench/workbench.desktop.main.css&quot;

cat &amp;gt;&amp;gt; &quot;$CSS_FILE&quot; &amp;lt;&amp;lt; &#39;EOF&#39;
.menubar-menu-title{font-size:23px!important}
.menubar&amp;gt;.menubar-menu-button{font-size:23px!important}
.monaco-menu-option{font-size:22px!important;line-height:34px!important}
.monaco-menu .action-label:not(.codicon){font-size:22px!important}
.menubar-menu-items-holder .monaco-menu .action-item .action-label{font-size:22px!important}
EOF&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_verwijder_de_integriteitswaarschuwing&quot;&gt;Verwijder de integriteitswaarschuwing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code detecteert de wijzigingen in zijn bestanden en toont een banner &quot;Your installation is corrupt&quot;. Om dit te voorkomen, verwijderen we de checksums van`product.json`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-python hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;python&quot;&gt;import json
product_json = &quot;$HOME/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/resources/app/product.json&quot;
with open(product_json, &#39;r&#39;) as f:
    data = json.load(f)
data.pop(&#39;checksums&#39;, None)
with open(product_json, &#39;w&#39;) as f:
    json.dump(data, f, indent=2)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Na het opnieuw opstarten zijn er geen waarschuwingen meer en zijn de menu&amp;#8217;s eindelijk leesbaar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_het_lettertype_van_het_explorer_venster_aanpassen_de_strijd&quot;&gt;Het lettertype van het Explorer-venster aanpassen — de strijd&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tentative_1_een_parameter_die_niet_bestaat&quot;&gt;Tentative 1 : een parameter die niet bestaat&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proberen eerst de native parameter`workbench.tree.fontSize`in`settings.json`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-json hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;json&quot;&gt;{
    &quot;workbench.tree.fontSize&quot;: 20
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resultaat :&lt;strong&gt;geen effect&lt;/strong&gt;. Deze instelling bestaat niet in VS Code. Het bewijs dat niet-herkende instellingen stilzwijgend worden genegeerd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tentative_2_de_extensie_custom_css_and_js_loader&quot;&gt;Tentative 2: de extensie Custom CSS and JS Loader&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We installeren de extensie`be5invis.vscode-custom-css`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/bin/code --install-extension be5invis.vscode-custom-css&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We maken een CSS-bestand in`~/.vscode-custom-css/custom.css`met selectors gericht op de elementen van de verkenner :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-css hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;css&quot;&gt;.monaco-tree-rows .monaco-tree-row,
.sidebar .monaco-list-row,
.explorer-viewlet .monaco-list-row,
.monaco-list-row .monaco-icon-label {
    font-size: 22px !important;
    line-height: 36px !important;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En we verwijzen naar dit bestand in de instellingen:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-json hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;json&quot;&gt;{
    &quot;vscode_custom_css.imports&quot;: [
        &quot;file:///home/user/.vscode-custom-css/custom.css&quot;
    ]
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resultaat :&lt;strong&gt;De wijzigingen worden niet toegepast&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_valkuil_je_moet_de_extensie_elke_keer_activeren&quot;&gt;De valkuil: je moet de extensie elke keer activeren&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De documentatie van de extensie is discreet over dit cruciale punt: na elke wijziging van de custom CSS, moet&lt;strong&gt;absoluut&lt;/strong&gt;voer de opdracht uit vanuit het palet :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Shift+P&lt;/code&gt;→ typen&lt;strong&gt;Aangepaste CSS en JS inschakelen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VS Code vraagt een herstart → accepteren&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zonder deze stap wordt de CSS nooit in de IDE geïnjecteerd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_poging_3_de_lijnen_overlappen&quot;&gt;Poging 3: de lijnen overlappen&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zelfs met`font-size: 22px` et &lt;code&gt;line-height: 36px&lt;/code&gt;, de letters met een staaf (g, p, f, b) steken uit op de naastgelegen lijnen. We proberen toe te voegen`height` et &lt;code&gt;min-height&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-css hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;css&quot;&gt;.monaco-list-row {
    height: 36px !important;
    min-height: 36px !important;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resultaat :&lt;strong&gt;geen wijziging&lt;/strong&gt;. VS Code berekent de regelhoogtes in JavaScript en overschrijft de CSS-waarden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_oplossing_zoom_op_de_oudercontainer&quot;&gt;De oplossing: &lt;code&gt;zoom&lt;/code&gt; op de oudercontainer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

rectangle &quot;Poging 1
Onbestaande parameter&quot; #LightCoral {
    card &quot;workbench.tree.fontSize&quot; as t1 {
        [VS Code ignore le paramètre]
    }
}

rectangle &quot;Poging 2
Aangepaste CSS + lettergrootte&quot; #LightYellow {
    card &quot;.monaco-list-row { font-size: 22px }&quot; as t2 {
        [Texte plus grand\nmais lignes superposées]
    }
}

rectangle &quot;Poging 3
font-size + line-height + height&quot; #LightYellow {
    card &quot;height: 36px !important&quot; as t3 {
        [VS Code override\npar JavaScript]
        [Aucun effet]
    }
}

rectangle &quot;Oplossing
zoom op ouder omhulsel&quot; #LightGreen {
    card &quot;.monaco-list-rows { zoom: 1.25 }&quot; as t4 {
        [Texte + espacement\nproportionnels]
        [Layout JS respecté]
        [✓ Résultat conforme]
    }
}

t1 -down-&amp;gt; t2 : Pas de paramètre ?\nOn essaie le CSS
t2 -down-&amp;gt; t3 : Lignes superposées ?\nOn force la hauteur
t3 -down-&amp;gt; t4 : Override JS ?\nOn utilise zoom

@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In plaats van te vechten tegen de JavaScript-layout, wordt de eigenschap gebruikt.`zoom`op de container van de lijnen :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-css hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;css&quot;&gt;.explorer-viewlet .monaco-list-rows,
.sidebar .monaco-list-rows {
    zoom: 1.25;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`zoom`vergroot uniform de rendering van de container — tekst EN spatie — zonder het door JavaScript van VS Code berekende layout te verbreken. De factor 1.25 komt ongeveer overeen met een overgang van 13px naar 16px.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resultaat :&lt;strong&gt;de bestandsnamen zijn eindelijk leesbaar, de regels zijn correct gespatieerd&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_samenvatting_van_selectors_en_wat_werkt&quot;&gt;Samenvatting van selectors en wat werkt&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Benadering&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;CSS&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Resultaat&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;font-size`op&lt;/code&gt;.monaco-list-row`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;font-size: 22px !important&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Grotere tekst maar overlappende lijnen&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;line-height&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;height`op&lt;/code&gt;.monaco-list-row`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;line-height: 36px; height: 36px&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Geen effect (override JS)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;zoom`op&lt;/code&gt;.monaco-list-rows`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;zoom: 1.25&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Geslaagd — tekst + proportionele spatiëring&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_het_script_voor_automatische_updates&quot;&gt;Het script voor automatische updates&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
autonumber

actor &quot;Ontwikkelaar
of cron&quot; as dev
participant &quot;vscode-update.sh&quot; as script
participant &quot;vscode tarball\n(code.visualstudio.com)&quot; as remote
participant &quot;~/apps/\nVSCode-linux-x64/&quot; as local
participant &quot;~/apps/
vscode-backup&quot; as backup
participant &quot;workbench
.desktop.main.css&quot; as css
participant &quot;product.json&quot; as product

dev -&amp;gt; script : ./vscode-update.sh
script -&amp;gt; local : Lire version courante
script -&amp;gt; remote : wget dernière version
script -&amp;gt; script : Comparer versions

alt Version identique
    script --&amp;gt; dev : &quot;Al up-to-date!&quot;
else Nouvelle version
    script -&amp;gt; backup : Sauvegarder installation courante\n(horodatée)
    script -&amp;gt; local : rm -rf ancienne installation
    script -&amp;gt; local : mv nouvelle installation
    script -&amp;gt; css : Ajouter patch CSS\n(menubar 23px, dropdown 22px)
    script -&amp;gt; product : Supprimer checksums\n(python3)
    script --&amp;gt; dev : &quot;Update voltooid
1.xx.yy → 1.zz.ww&quot;
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_het_probleem&quot;&gt;Het probleem&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wanneer VS Code wordt bijgewerkt, vervangt het de installatiemap en&lt;strong&gt;Wis alle CSS-patches&lt;/strong&gt;. U moet de wijzigingen elke keer handmatig opnieuw toepassen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_het_script_vscode_update_sh&quot;&gt;Het script `vscode-update.sh&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We maken`~/apps/vscode-update.sh`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;#!/bin/bash
set -e

VSCODE_DIR=&quot;$HOME/apps/VSCode-linux-x64&quot;
BACKUP_DIR=&quot;$HOME/apps/vscode-backup&quot;
TEMP_DIR=&quot;/tmp/vscode-update&quot;

MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE=&quot;23px&quot;
DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE=&quot;22px&quot;

echo &quot;=== VS Code Local Updater ===&quot;

CURRENT_VERSION=$(&quot;$VSCODE_DIR/bin/code&quot; --version 2&amp;gt;/dev/null | head -1)
echo &quot;Current version: $CURRENT_VERSION&quot;

echo &quot;Downloading latest VS Code...&quot;
mkdir -p &quot;$TEMP_DIR&quot;
wget -q &quot;https://code.visualstudio.com/sha/download?build=stable&amp;amp;os=linux-x64&quot; \
    -O &quot;$TEMP_DIR/vscode.tar.gz&quot;

echo &quot;Extracting...&quot;
mkdir -p &quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted&quot;
tar -xzf &quot;$TEMP_DIR/vscode.tar.gz&quot; -C &quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted&quot;

NEW_VERSION=$(&quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted/VSCode-linux-x64/bin/code&quot; \
    --version 2&amp;gt;/dev/null | head -1)
echo &quot;New version: $NEW_VERSION&quot;

if [ &quot;$CURRENT_VERSION&quot; = &quot;$NEW_VERSION&quot; ]; then
    echo &quot;Already up to date!&quot;
    rm -rf &quot;$TEMP_DIR&quot;
    exit 0
fi

echo &quot;Backing up current installation...&quot;
mkdir -p &quot;$BACKUP_DIR&quot;
cp -r &quot;$VSCODE_DIR&quot; &quot;$BACKUP_DIR/VSCode-linux-x64-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)&quot;

echo &quot;Updating...&quot;
rm -rf &quot;$VSCODE_DIR&quot;
mv &quot;$TEMP_DIR/extracted/VSCode-linux-x64&quot; &quot;$VSCODE_DIR&quot;
rm -rf &quot;$TEMP_DIR&quot;

CSS_FILE=&quot;$VSCODE_DIR/resources/app/out/vs/workbench/workbench.desktop.main.css&quot;
echo &quot;Re-applying custom CSS patch \
    (menubar=${MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE}, dropdown=${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE})...&quot;
cat &amp;gt;&amp;gt; &quot;$CSS_FILE&quot; &amp;lt;&amp;lt; CSSEOF
.menubar-menu-title{font-size:${MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE}!important}\
.menubar&amp;gt;.menubar-menu-button{font-size:${MENUBAR_FONT_SIZE}!important}\
.monaco-menu-option{font-size:${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE}!important;\
line-height:34px!important}\
.monaco-menu .action-label:not(.codicon)\
{font-size:${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE}!important}\
.menubar-menu-items-holder .monaco-menu .action-item .action-label\
{font-size:${DROPDOWN_FONT_SIZE}!important}
CSSEOF

PRODUCT_JSON=&quot;$VSCODE_DIR/resources/app/product.json&quot;
if [ -f &quot;$PRODUCT_JSON&quot; ]; then
    echo &quot;Removing checksums to prevent integrity warning...&quot;
    python3 -c &quot;
import json
with open(&#39;$PRODUCT_JSON&#39;,&#39;r&#39;) as f: data=json.load(f)
data.pop(&#39;checksums&#39;, None)
with open(&#39;$PRODUCT_JSON&#39;,&#39;w&#39;) as f: json.dump(data,f,indent=2)
print(&#39;Done.&#39;)
&quot;
fi

echo &quot;=== Update complete: $CURRENT_VERSION -&amp;gt; $NEW_VERSION ===&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Het script :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Download de nieuwste stabiele versie&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Controleer of de versie verschilt van de huidige&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewaar de huidige installatie (getimestamp) in`~/apps/vscode-backup/`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vervang de installatiemap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opnieuw aanbrengen&lt;/strong&gt;de CSS-patch van het hoofdmenu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verwijder de checksums&lt;/strong&gt; de `product.json`om de integriteitswaarschuwing te voorkomen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
Aanpassingen van het Verkenner via de Custom CSS-extensie en het bestand`~/.vscode-custom-css/custom.css`Ze overleven updates omdat ze buiten de installatiemap leven.
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_betrokken_bestanden_overzicht&quot;&gt;Betrokken bestanden — overzicht&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle &quot;Installatie VS Code\n(~/apps/VSCode-linux-x64/)&quot; #LightCoral {
    component &quot;workbench.desktop\n.main.css&quot; as css #LightCoral
    component &quot;product.json&quot; as product #LightCoral
    component &quot;binair\nbin/code&quot; as binary #LightCoral
}

rectangle &quot;Configuration gebruiker
(~/.config/Code/)&quot; #LightGreen {
    component &quot;settings.json&quot; as settings #LightGreen
    component &quot;extensies/&quot; as extensions #LightGreen
}

rectangle &quot;Duurzame aanpassing
(~/.vscode-custom-css/)&quot; #SkyBlue {
    component &quot;custom.css\n(zoom: 1.25)&quot; as customcss #SkyBlue
}

rectangle &quot;Automatisering\n(~/apps/)&quot; #LightYellow {
    component &quot;vscode-update.sh&quot; as script #LightYellow
    component &quot;vscode-backup/&quot; as backup #LightYellow
}

script ..&amp;gt; css : Re-patch après MAJ
script ..&amp;gt; product : Supprime checksums\naprès MAJ
settings --&amp;gt; customcss : Référence via\nvscode_custom_css.imports
extensions ..&amp;gt; css : Custom CSS Loader\ninjecte custom.css

note bottom of css
  **Ne survit pas** aux mises à jour
  Re-patché par le script
end note

note bottom of customcss
  **Survit** aux mises à jour
  Vit hors du dossier d&#39;installation
end note

note bottom of settings
  **Survit** aux mises à jour
  Vit dans ~/.config/
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
