&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_context_en_doel&quot;&gt;Context en doel&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_het_startpunt&quot;&gt;Het startpunt&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Het project`slider-gradle`genereert Reveal.js-presentaties van AsciiDoc-bestanden via de Gradle-plugin`org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs`. De configuratie van de hoofdtaak`asciidoctorRevealJs`leefde direct in het hoofd buildscript`build.gradle.kts`(Empty output)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;plugins { id(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&quot;) }

apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()

project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
    repositories { ruby { gems() } }
    revealjs {
        version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
        templateGitHub {
            setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
            setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
            setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
        }
    }
    revealjsOptions {
        // ... configuration complète
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_het_doel&quot;&gt;Het doel&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verplaats deze hele configuratie naar`buildSrc/src/main/kotlin/slides/SlidesPlugin.kt`zodat het buildscript van de consument wordt teruggebracht tot:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De plug‑in moet volledig autonoom zijn: hij past zijn plug‑in‑afhankelijkheden zelf toe, configureert zijn repositories, en beheert zijn Ruby‑gems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_het_eerste_obstakel_ruby_gems&quot;&gt;Het eerste obstakel : `ruby { gems() }&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_wat_de_groovy_syntactische_suiker_verbirgt&quot;&gt;Wat de Groovy syntactische suiker verbirgt&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De lijn`repositories { ruby { gems() } }`is een Groovy DSL-extensie die alleen beschikbaar is in de uitvoeringscontext van het buildscript. Het bestaat niet als een statische Kotlin-API die toegankelijk is vanaf buildSrc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij het proberen om hem/haar te bellen vanaf`SlidesPlugin.kt`, de compilatie mislukt onmiddellijk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ontbinding_van_het_mechanisme&quot;&gt;Ontbinding van het mechanisme&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Na analyse van de Gradle-cache (&lt;code&gt;~/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/rubygems/&lt;/code&gt;), ontdekken we in het bestand`ivy-3.1.0.xml`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-xml hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;xml&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;artifact type=&#39;gem&#39; url=&#39;https://rubygems.org/gems/asciidoctor-revealjs-3.1.0.gem&#39; /&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`ruby { gems() }`voerde eigenlijk uit&lt;strong&gt;drie afzonderlijke operaties&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een Ivy-repo opslaan dat naar &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203; verwijst`https://rubygems.org/gems/`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Groep uitsluiten`rubygems`Maven-repositories om conflicten te voorkomen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sla de gem op in de configuratie`asciidoctorGems`zodaat JRuby het tijdens runtime laadt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deze drie verantwoordelijkheden moeten apart in Kotlin gereproduceerd worden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_de_oplossing_in_drie_delen&quot;&gt;De oplossing in drie delen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_deel_1_de_ivy_repo_voor_rubygems&quot;&gt;Deel 1: de Ivy-repo voor RubyGems&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.repositories.mavenCentral() {
    content { excludeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
}
project.repositories.ivy {
    url = project.uri(&quot;https://rubygems.org/gems/&quot;)
    patternLayout { artifact(&quot;[module]-[revision].gem&quot;) } &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;
    metadataSources { artifact() }
    content { includeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;De extensie`.gem`moet hard gecodeerd zijn.&lt;code&gt;[ext]`lost standaard in&lt;/code&gt;.jar`, wat een fout veroorzaakt`Resource missing`.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
De Ivy-repo wordt direct aangekondigd op`project.repositories`en niet in een blok`repositories { }`omdat de receiver van dit blok niet de`RepositoryHandler`standaard van Gradle maar een API grolifant onverenigbaar met de extensie`ivy`Kotlin DSL
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_deel_2_de_afhankelijkheid_asciidoctorgems&quot;&gt;Deel 2: de afhankelijkheid asciidoctorGems&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De plugin`org.asciidoctor.jvm.gems`moet eerst worden toegepast — het creëert de configuratie`asciidoctorGems`en de taak`asciidoctorGemsPrepare` :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.plugins.apply(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.gems&quot;)
project.plugins.apply(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&quot;) &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;

project.dependencies {
    add(&quot;asciidoctorGems&quot;, &quot;rubygems:asciidoctor-revealjs:3.1.0@gem&quot;) &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(2)&lt;/b&gt;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;De volgorde van toepassing is belangrijk:`gems`voor`revealjs`. &amp;lt;2&amp;gt; De kwalificator`@gem`Forceer de juiste extensie op de afhankelijkheid.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_deel_3_settings_gradle_kts&quot;&gt;Deel 3 : `settings.gradle.kts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`dependencyResolutionManagement`in`settings.gradle.kts`moet de projecten toestaan hun eigen repositories te verklaren :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Suppress(&quot;UnstableApiUsage&quot;)
dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.PREFER_PROJECT)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zonder deze regel, Gradle negeert de in de plugin gedeclareerde repositories en mislukt de oplosser van de gems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_de_api_introspectie_via_bytecodes&quot;&gt;De API-introspectie via bytecodes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_waarom_javap&quot;&gt;Waarom &lt;code&gt;javap&lt;/code&gt;?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De plugin`asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides`is in versie`4.0.0-alpha.1`. De documentatie is niet bestaand of onvolledig. De enige betrouwbare bron is de directe inspectie van de gecompileerde klassen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_hiërarchie_van_de_taak&quot;&gt;Hiërarchie van de taak&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resultaat :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask
  extends org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask
  implements org.asciidoctor.gradle.base.slides.SlidesToExportAware&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ontdekking_van_forkoptions&quot;&gt;Ontdekking van `forkOptions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij het inspecteren`AbstractAsciidoctorTask`[Translation of empty string: nothing]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask | grep -i &quot;fork\|exec\|jvm&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Men vindt:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;final org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions javaForkOptions;
public void forkOptions(org.gradle.api.Action&amp;lt;org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions&amp;gt;);
public static final org.asciidoctor.gradle.base.process.ProcessMode JAVA_EXEC;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_api_van_javaforkoptions_grolifant&quot;&gt;De API van JavaForkOptions (grolifant)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`javaLauncher`bestaat niet op deze taak. De echte API van`org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions`tentoonstelling :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public void executable(java.lang.Object);  &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;
public void setExecutable(java.lang.Object);&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;De methode`executable(Object)`vervang de toewijzing`executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;`die niet compileert (`val`kan niet opnieuw worden toegewezen).&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_revealjsextension&quot;&gt;RevealJSExtension&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`revealjs { }`is geen methode van de taak maar een&lt;strong&gt;uitbreiding van het project&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.RevealJSExtension&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ze wordt via :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;().apply {
    version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
    templateGitHub {
        setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
        setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
        setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_configuratie_van_de_java_toolchain&quot;&gt;Configuratie van de Java toolchain&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_het_probleem_van_javatoolchainservice&quot;&gt;Het probleem van JavaToolchainService&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`JavaToolchainService`Het is geen projectuitbreiding. De volgende aanroep mislukt :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ERREUR : Extension of type &#39;JavaToolchainService&#39; does not exist
project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De goede API is`serviceOf`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;import org.gradle.kotlin.dsl.support.serviceOf

project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
    setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)
    forkOptions {
        executable(
            project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()
                .launcherFor {
                    languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(17))
                    vendor.set(JvmVendorSpec.ADOPTIUM)
                }
                .get()
                .executablePath
                .asFile
                .absolutePath
        )
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_automatische_detectie_docker&quot;&gt;Automatische detectie Docker&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_context&quot;&gt;Context&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De Asciidoctor/JRuby-plugin vereist Java 17. Kotlin 2.0.x in buildSrc ondersteunt Java 25 niet (de versieparser crasht op`&quot;25.0.2&quot;`). De Gradle-daemon moet dus draaien op Java 17 of Docker moet worden gebruikt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_strategie&quot;&gt;Strategie&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker beschikbaar → uitvoering via container`eclipse-temurin:17`(standaardgedrag)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker afwezig + Java 17 → lokale uitvoering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker ontbreekt + Java &amp;gt; 17 → expliciete fout&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val isDockerAvailable = try {
    Runtime.getRuntime().exec(arrayOf(&quot;docker&quot;, &quot;info&quot;)).waitFor() == 0
} catch (e: Exception) {
    false
}

val javaVersion = JavaVersion.current().majorVersion.toInt()

when {
    isDockerAvailable -&amp;gt; project.tasks.register&amp;lt;Exec&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
        group = GROUP_TASK_SLIDER
        description = &quot;Slider settings and generation (via Docker)&quot;
        dependsOn(TASK_CLEAN_SLIDES_BUILD)
        finalizedBy(TASK_DASHBOARD_SLIDES_BUILD)
        commandLine(
            &quot;docker&quot;, &quot;run&quot;, &quot;--rm&quot;,
            &quot;-v&quot;, &quot;${project.rootDir.absolutePath}:/workspace&quot;,
            &quot;-v&quot;, &quot;${System.getProperty(&quot;user.home&quot;)}/.gradle:/root/.gradle&quot;,
            &quot;-w&quot;, &quot;/workspace&quot;,
            &quot;eclipse-temurin:17&quot;,
            &quot;./gradlew&quot;, TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS
        )
        workingDir = project.rootDir
    }
    javaVersion == 17 -&amp;gt; {
        project.repositories.mavenCentral() {
            content { excludeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
        }
        project.repositories.ivy {
            url = project.uri(&quot;https://rubygems.org/gems/&quot;)
            patternLayout { artifact(&quot;[module]-[revision].gem&quot;) }
            metadataSources { artifact() }
            content { includeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
        }
        project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;().apply {
            version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
            templateGitHub {
                setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
                setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
                setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
            }
        }
        project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
            setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)
            forkOptions {
                executable(
                    project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()
                        .launcherFor {
                            languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(17))
                            vendor.set(JvmVendorSpec.ADOPTIUM)
                        }
                        .get()
                        .executablePath
                        .asFile
                        .absolutePath
                )
            }
            // ... reste de la configuration
        }
    }
    else -&amp;gt; error(
        &quot;Docker est requis pour exécuter $TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS &quot; +
        &quot;avec Java $javaVersion. Installez Docker ou utilisez Java 17.&quot;
    )
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_eindresultaat&quot;&gt;Eindresultaat&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_de_consumenten_buildscript&quot;&gt;De consumenten buildscript&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dat is alles. De plugin draagt de volledige verantwoordelijkheid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_settings_gradle_kts&quot;&gt;settings.gradle.kts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;pluginManagement {
    repositories {
        mavenLocal()
        gradlePluginPortal()
    }
}

plugins {
    id(&quot;org.gradle.toolchains.foojay-resolver-convention&quot;) version &quot;0.8.0&quot;
}

@Suppress(&quot;UnstableApiUsage&quot;)
dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.PREFER_PROJECT)
}

rootProject.name = &quot;slider-gradle&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_samenvatting_van_de_valkuilen_en_oplossingen&quot;&gt;Samenvatting van de valkuilen en oplossingen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 37.5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 37.5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;probleem&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Oorzaak&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Oplossing&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`ruby { gems() }`niet beschikbaar in Kotlin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Alleen Groovy DSL-extensie&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Drie gescheiden mechanismen : repo Ivy + Maven-uitsluiting +&lt;code&gt;asciidoctorGems&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Gradle zoekt een`.jar`in plaats van een`.gem`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`[ext]`lost op en`jar`standaard&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hardcoder`.gem`in het patroon Ivy + kwalificatie`@gem`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;ivy { }`compileert niet in`repositories { }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Receiver grolifant onverenigbaar met de Kotlin DSL&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Directe oproep`project.repositories.ivy { }`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`javaLauncher`onopgelost&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Niet-bestaande eigenschap op`AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;forkOptions { executable(&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;) }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;`compileert niet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Eigendom`val`in`JavaForkOptions`grolifant&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Methode`executable(Object)`in de plaats&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;JavaToolchainService`niet gevonden via`extensions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Dit is een Gradle-service, geen extensie&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`revealjs { }`niet opgelost in de taak&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Projectuitbreiding, geen taakmethode&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Build crasht met Java 25&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kotlin 2.0.x parseert geen Java-versies met twee cijfers&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Automatische Docker-detectie + fallback Java 17&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_onderzoeksmethode_een_onbekende_api_lezen_met_javap&quot;&gt;Onderzoeksmethode : een onbekende API lezen met javap&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_principe&quot;&gt;Principe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als de documentatie ontbreekt of incompleet is, zijn de bytecodes de bron van waarheid. &lt;code&gt;javap`is het standaardhulpmiddel van de JDK die bestanden decompileert&lt;/code&gt;.class`in leesbare Java-handtekeningen, zonder de broncode nodig te hebben&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_stap_1_zoek_de_jar_in_de_gradle_cache&quot;&gt;Stap 1: zoek de jar in de Gradle-cache&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gradle downloadt al zijn afhankelijkheden in`~/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/`. De eerste stap is om de jar te vinden die de te inspecteren klasse bevat :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Resultaat :&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;/home/user/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/org.asciidoctor/
asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides/4.0.0-alpha.1/.../
asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_stap_2_de_klassen_van_de_jar_opsommen&quot;&gt;Stap 2: de klassen van de jar opsommen&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voordat we een klasse inspecteren, controleren we of deze bestaat in de jar :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;jar tf asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar | grep -i &quot;RevealJS\|revealjs&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_stap_3_een_klasse_inspecteren&quot;&gt;Stap 3 : een klasse inspecteren&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Dit onthult alle beschikbare klassen : &lt;code&gt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RevealJSExtension&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RevealJSOptions&lt;/code&gt;, etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De optie`-p`toont alle leden inclusief de privé-leden. Het resultaat toont onmiddellijk de sleutelregel:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask
extends org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_stap_4_de_hiërarchie_beklimmen&quot;&gt;Stap 4: de hiërarchie beklimmen&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De taak strekt uit`AbstractAsciidoctorTask`. We inspecteren het op zijn beurt door eerst zijn jar te vinden :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-[0-9]*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null

javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask | grep -i &quot;fork\|exec\|jvm\|java&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daar ontdekken we`forkOptions`, &lt;code&gt;JAVA_EXEC&lt;/code&gt;, et &lt;code&gt;javaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt; van het type`org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_stap_5_onbekende_typen_volgen&quot;&gt;Stap 5: onbekende typen volgen&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`JavaForkOptions`is een grolifant onbekende klasse. Zijn jar wordt gelokaliseerd:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;grolifant*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daarna inspecteren we het:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath grolifant40-legacy-api-2.0.0-alpha.6.jar \
org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daar vind je`executable(java.lang.Object)&lt;code&gt;— de juiste methode om aan te roepen, in tegenstelling tot`executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;`die niet compileert omdat het een eigenschap is`val&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_stap_6_controleer_de_projectextensies&quot;&gt;Stap 6: controleer de projectextensies&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voor`revealjs { }`, de vraag was: is dit een methode van de taak of een projectuitbreiding? De inspectie van`AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask` toont geen methode`revealjs`. Men inspecteert dan`RevealJSExtension`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.RevealJSExtension | head -5&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class RevealJSExtension implements groovy.lang.GroovyObject {
public static final java.lang.String NAME;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De aanwezigheid van`NAME`bevestigt dat het een geregistreerde extensie is op het project, toegankelijk via`project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;()`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_samenvatting_van_de_methode&quot;&gt;Samenvatting van de methode&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 75%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Stap&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Actie&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;*.jar&quot;&lt;/code&gt;— de jar lokaliseren&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;jar tf jar.jar | grep NomClasse&lt;/code&gt;— controleer of de klasse bestaat&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;javap -p -classpath jar.jar NomCompletClasse&lt;/code&gt;— de klasse inspecteren&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Identificeren`extends`en de hiërarchie beklimmen&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Volg onbekende types in hun eigen jars&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;zoeken`NAME`om een projectextensie te identificeren&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deze methode is van toepassing op elke Gradle-plugin waarvan de API niet is gedocumenteerd. of waarvan de alpha-versie niet meer overeenkomt met de bestaande documentatie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_volgende_stap&quot;&gt;Volgende stap&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dit buildSrc-plugin wordt geëxtraheerd naar een apart project dat wordt gepubliceerd op de Gradle Plugin Portal of Maven Local. Het consumer-buildscript wordt dan:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;plugins { id(&quot;slides&quot;) version &quot;1.0.0&quot; }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Et &lt;code&gt;settings.gradle.kts`zal worden teruggebracht tot het strenge minimum zonder verwijzing naar`foojay-resolver-convention&lt;/code&gt;, het JDK-provisioning wordt beheerd door de plugin zelf of wordt gedocumenteerd als vereiste.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
