&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_declaratieve_configuratie&quot;&gt;Declaratieve configuratie&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_architectuur_van_de_plugin&quot;&gt;Architectuur van de plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_definitie_van_de_dsl_extensie&quot;&gt;Definitie van de DSL-extensie&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_definitie_van_de_aangepaste_taak&quot;&gt;Definitie van de aangepaste taak&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_interface_gitadapter&quot;&gt;Interface GitAdapter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_concrete_implementatie_met_jgit&quot;&gt;Concrete implementatie met JGit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_configuratie_dsl_kotlin&quot;&gt;Configuratie DSL Kotlin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_eenheidstests_met_mockito&quot;&gt;Eenheidstests met Mockito&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_afhankelijkheden&quot;&gt;Afhankelijkheden&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_test_van_het_gedrag_van_git&quot;&gt;Test van het gedrag van Git&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_conclusie&quot;&gt;Conclusie&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_volgende_stappen&quot;&gt;Volgende stappen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dit bericht beschrijft het volledige ontwerpproces en testen (TDD) van een Gradle-plugin geschreven in Kotlin DSL. Dit plugin automatiseert de generatie van statische sites met &lt;strong&gt;JBake&lt;/strong&gt; en de &lt;strong&gt;Git-implementatie&lt;/strong&gt; via &lt;strong&gt;JGit&lt;/strong&gt;, allemaal vanaf een YAML-configuratiebestand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_doel&quot;&gt;doel&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een Gradle-plugin maken:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;configureerbaar in Kotlin DSL;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;in staat om&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;genereer een statische site vanuit JBake ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;implementeren op een externe Git-opslagplaats via JGit ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;integreerbaar in een CI/CD-workflow;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;getest volgens een TDD-aanpak.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_declaratieve_configuratie&quot;&gt;Declaratieve configuratie&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hier is een voorbeeld van een YAML-configuratie om te modelleren in onze DSL :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-yaml hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;yaml&quot;&gt;bake:
  srcPath: &quot;./site/jbake&quot;
  destDirPath: &quot;bake&quot;
pushPage:
  from: &quot;bake&quot;
  to: &quot;cvs&quot;
  repo:
    name: &quot;trainings&quot;
    repository: &quot;https://github.com/pages-content/trainings.git&quot;
    credentials:
      username: &quot;USERNAME&quot;
      password: &quot;SECRET_TOKEN&quot;
  branch: &quot;main&quot;
  message: &quot;cheroliv.com&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deze configuratie wordt weergegeven via een declareerbare Gradle-extensie in Kotlin DSL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_architectuur_van_de_plugin&quot;&gt;Architectuur van de plugin&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
package &quot;engine-plugin&quot; {
class WorkspaceEngineExtension
class GenerateSiteTask
interface GitAdapter
class JGitAdapter
WorkspaceEnginePlugin --&amp;gt; WorkspaceEngineExtension
WorkspaceEnginePlugin --&amp;gt; GenerateSiteTask
GenerateSiteTask --&amp;gt; GitAdapter
JGitAdapter ..|&amp;gt; GitAdapter
}
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_definitie_van_de_dsl_extensie&quot;&gt;Definitie van de DSL-extensie&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;open class WorkspaceEngineExtension {
    var outputDir: String = &quot;build/site&quot;
    var template: String = &quot;freemarker&quot;
    var repoUrl: String = &quot;&quot;
    var branch: String = &quot;main&quot;
    var message: String = &quot;Generated by engine&quot;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_definitie_van_de_aangepaste_taak&quot;&gt;Definitie van de aangepaste taak&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;abstract class GenerateSiteTask : DefaultTask() {
    lateinit var gitAdapter: GitAdapter

    @get:Input abstract val repoUrl: Property&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;
    @get:InputDirectory abstract val outputDir: DirectoryProperty
    @get:Input abstract val branch: Property&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;
    @get:Input abstract val message: Property&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;

    @TaskAction
    fun run() {
        val repo = gitAdapter.cloneRepository(repoUrl.get(), outputDir.get().asFile)
        gitAdapter.commitAndPush(repo, branch.get(), message.get())
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_interface_gitadapter&quot;&gt;Interface GitAdapter&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;interface GitAdapter {
    fun cloneRepository(uri: String, directory: File): Repository
    fun commitAndPush(repo: Repository, branch: String, message: String)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_concrete_implementatie_met_jgit&quot;&gt;Concrete implementatie met JGit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;class JGitAdapter : GitAdapter {
    override fun cloneRepository(uri: String, directory: File): Repository {
        return Git.cloneRepository()
            .setURI(uri)
            .setDirectory(directory)
            .call()
            .repository
    }

    override fun commitAndPush(repo: Repository, branch: String, message: String) {
        Git(repo).use {
            it.add().addFilepattern(&quot;.&quot;).call()
            it.commit().setMessage(message).call()
            it.push().call()
        }
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_configuratie_dsl_kotlin&quot;&gt;Configuratie DSL Kotlin&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;workspaceEngine {
    outputDir = &quot;build/out&quot;
    template = &quot;freemarker&quot;
    repoUrl = &quot;https://github.com/cheroliv/trainings.git&quot;
    branch = &quot;main&quot;
    message = &quot;deploy from plugin&quot;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_eenheidstests_met_mockito&quot;&gt;Eenheidstests met Mockito&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_afhankelijkheden&quot;&gt;Afhankelijkheden&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;testImplementation(&quot;org.mockito:mockito-core:5.12.0&quot;)
testImplementation(&quot;org.mockito.kotlin:mockito-kotlin:5.2.1&quot;)
testImplementation(&quot;org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter:5.10.0&quot;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_test_van_het_gedrag_van_git&quot;&gt;Test van het gedrag van Git&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;class GenerateSiteTaskMockitoTest {

    @TempDir
    lateinit var tempDir: File

    @Test
    fun `task should call clone and commitAndPush`() {
        val project = ProjectBuilder.builder().build()
        val task = project.tasks.create(&quot;generateSite&quot;, GenerateSiteTask::class.java)

        val mockGitAdapter = mock&amp;lt;GitAdapter&amp;gt;()
        val mockRepo = mock&amp;lt;Repository&amp;gt;()

        whenever(mockGitAdapter.cloneRepository(any(), any())).thenReturn(mockRepo)

        task.gitAdapter = mockGitAdapter
        task.repoUrl.set(&quot;https://github.com/cheroliv/test.git&quot;)
        task.outputDir.set(project.layout.projectDirectory.dir(tempDir.name))
        task.branch.set(&quot;main&quot;)
        task.message.set(&quot;test commit&quot;)

        task.run()

        verify(mockGitAdapter).cloneRepository(eq(&quot;https://github.com/cheroliv/test.git&quot;), any())
        verify(mockGitAdapter).commitAndPush(eq(mockRepo), eq(&quot;main&quot;), eq(&quot;test commit&quot;))
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
actor &quot;Ontwikkelaar&quot; as Dev
participant &quot;Gradle ProjectBuilder&quot; as Project
participant &quot;GenereerSiteTaak&quot; as Task
participant &quot;GitAdapter (Mock)&quot; as Adapter
participant &quot;JGitAdapter / Mockito&quot; as Impl

Dev -&amp;gt; Project : construit projet Gradle
Dev -&amp;gt; Task : configure les propriétés
Task -&amp;gt; Adapter : cloneRepository()
Adapter -&amp;gt; Impl : simulé par Mockito
Task -&amp;gt; Adapter : commitAndPush()
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conclusie&quot;&gt;Conclusie&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scheiding van verantwoordelijkheden via`GitAdapter`Hiermee kan TDD volledig worden toegepast bij de ontwikkeling van Gradle-plugins :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De Git-aanroepen zijn geabstraheerd en testbaar;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De DSL-configuratie is netjes en overzichtelijk;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;het plugin blijft agnostisch ten opzichte van de werkelijke implementatie&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deze aanpak garandeert een hoge testbaarheid en uitbreidbaarheid (naar GitHub API, GitLab, enz.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_volgende_stappen&quot;&gt;Volgende stappen&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De JBake-generatie integreren als een`BakeAdapter`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voeg integratietests toe met`GradleRunner`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ondersteun het automatisch laden van bestanden`site.yml`via SnakeYAML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;Sommaire&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_inleiding&quot;&gt;Inleiding&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
