&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ik heb geen zin om te installerenhttps://www.pgadmin.org/[pgAdmin] ou &lt;a href=&quot;http://phppgadmin.sourceforge.net/&quot;&gt;phppgadmin&lt;/a&gt; terwijl alles aanwezig is op de opdrachtregel&lt;br&gt;
Daarvoor moeten we de terminal starten en inloggen als de postgres-gebruiker.&lt;br&gt;
de user postgres is de enige die standaard het recht om de applicatie psql te starten heeft, die de opdrachtregelclient is (&lt;a href=&quot;https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interface_en_ligne_de_commande&quot;&gt;CLI&lt;/a&gt;) postgresql,&lt;br&gt;
om met de database via de commandoregel vanaf de terminal te kunnen communiceren&lt;br&gt;
Om verbinding te maken, open de terminal en typ dit:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ sudo -i -u postgres&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Om verbinding te maken en direct naar de PostgreSQL-opdrachtprompt te gaan, typ dit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ sudo -i -u postgres psql&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Om de databases van een PostgreSQL-instantie op te lijsten, hier is de opdracht :&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-SQL hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;SQL&quot;&gt;postgres=# \l&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;resultaat:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lijst van databases Naam    | Eigenaar | Codering | Collatie | Karaktertype |    Toegangsrechten&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fiber     | tech         | UTF8     | fr_FR.UTF-8     | fr_FR.UTF-8  | =Tc/tech&lt;br&gt;
|              |          |                 |              | tech=CTc/tech fiberdev  | tech         | UTF8     | fr_FR.UTF-8     | fr_FR.UTF-8  | =Tc/tech&lt;br&gt;
|              |          |                 |              | tech=CTc/tech fiberweb  | tech         | UTF8     | fr_FR.UTF-8     | fr_FR.UTF-8  | =Tc/tech&lt;br&gt;
|              |          |                 |              | tech=CTc/tech postgres  | postgres     | UTF8     | fr_FR.UTF-8     | fr_FR.UTF-8  | template0 | postgres     | UTF8     | fr_FR.UTF-8     | fr_FR.UTF-8  | =c/postgres&lt;br&gt;
|              |          |                 |              | postgres=CTc/postgres template1 | postgres     | UTF8     | fr_FR.UTF-8     | fr_FR.UTF-8  | =c/postgres&lt;br&gt;
|              |          |                 |              | postgres=CTc/postgres (6 lignes)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Druk q om de resultaten weergave te verlaten&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
om de schema&amp;#8217;s van een instantie van postgresl op te lijsten&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-sql hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;sql&quot;&gt;postgres=# SELECT schema_name FROM information_schema.schemata;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;resultaat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;openbaar information_schema pg_catalog pg_toast_temp_1 pg_temp_1 pg_toast (6 regels)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ou&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-sql hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;sql&quot;&gt;postgres=# SELECT nspname FROM pg_catalog.pg_namespace;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
